// - a prior A55.50+ runtime that positively reports safeToReplace/running=false/tick=false/no requests-reservations-pendingBuy may have a stale singleton slot retired after dispose if the slot itself failed to clear. This is fail-closed proof-based reclamation only; active/ambiguous runtimes are never force-replaced;
// - Auto Loot v1.116 uses the existing v1.114+ contextBound/market-read coexistence contract and remains read-only to Auction; no economics, request ceilings, 3100ms mutation floor, revenue policy, Smart Buy/Warehouse/HIGH_ROLLER, reconnect, List-All or F7/F8 behavior is weakened.
