// - dispatched LIST response timeouts receive the same no-duplicate uncertain-success reconciliation treatment as A55.48 shutdown-after-handoff cancellation instead of inflating unknown protocol errors;
// - A55.50 deterministic hot-reload, A55.49 peer/stash, A55.48 shutdown/revenue, A55.47 market-read coexistence, A55.46 wallet, A55.45 budget-window, A51/A52 economics/governors and all prior Smart Buy/Warehouse/HIGH_ROLLER/reconnect/input protections remain cumulative.
// A55.46 shared-core DUNGEON WALLET-AUTHORITY SELF-HEAL + FALSE-ZERO HARDENING:
// - live A55.44-D + Auto Loot v1.112 evidence exposed a source-authority bootstrap failure: CurrencyModel.currenciesInfo.getCurrencyCount(101) returns 0 both for a real zero balance and for an unhydrated currency table. Auction latched that false zero, scanned 1,816 governed market reads for 14.3 minutes, and authorized 0 buys/listings despite 149,112g becoming visible at teardown;
// - Auction now proves liquid-gold authority by requiring an actual CurrencyInfo entry for cfgId 101, not merely the numeric getCurrencyCount() fallback. Uninitialized/missing currency state can no longer overwrite lastObservedGold or silently masquerade as a real zero wallet;
// - before autonomous market writes/scanning proceed from a live context, Auction performs one governed source-backed CurrencyModel.requestCurrencyInfo() hydration through the existing paced request lane. The refresh therefore inherits request ceilings, List-All final-dispatch ownership, network-generation cancellation, Auto Loot yielding, timeout/backoff and safe-unload protections;
// - a genuinely empty wallet remains valid after cfgId 101 is present with count 0. If authority cannot be proven, Auction fails closed and holds market work instead of burning thousands of scans with a zero budget;
// - runtime starting-gold accounting is established only from proven currency authority, preventing false +149k wallet-delta reports after late model hydration;
// - adds wallet-authority status/session telemetry and conservative stall-capacity diagnostics; no Auction economics, 3100ms mutation floor, Dungeon revenue deferral, v1.110+ peer headroom, Smart Buy/Warehouse/HIGH_ROLLER/reconnect or Auto Loot state is relaxed or mutated.
