/// - Dungeon stage detection remains enabled in BOTH profiles as a safety boundary. The Lobby build fails closed if accidentally carried into Dungeon: full Auction HUD/input is released, reconnect UI is suppressed, and market traffic pauses until Camp returns. It does NOT run the reduced Dungeon market profile or micro HUD;
