        liquidity: 'Enable the fast-moving liquidity lane for markets with enough demand and turnover evidence.',
        readonly: 'Scan the full market without dispatching buys or listings until turned off.',
        hoard: 'Keep script-acquired positions instead of automatically listing them for sale.',
        vip: 'Restrict special VIP waiting logic to the currently verified high-value target registry.',
        graph: 'Show or hide the one-minute sales/profit history graph.',
        dynamic: 'Scale reserve, single-buy size, session spend and active positions to current gold; hard bankroll safety still remains.',
        transfer: 'Detect suspicious transfer/anomaly patterns and quarantine bait-like price levels.',
        smartstall: 'Ordinary sniper-owned stall manager only: under slot pressure it can replace weaker exact script listings; stale Forging uses adaptive no-sale grace (5–15m, hard age 20m) plus deposit-loss caps. Warehouse has a separate auto-reprice/park brain; manual listings are never touched.',
        hotcat: 'Revisit stronger-demand Urban/Forging categories more often without lowering any buy/economic safety gate.',
