        mode_aggressive: 'Aggressive: Rare, Excellent and Epic are primary targets in the locked Item wall-farm universe; keeps one AH stall slot free.',
        mode_middle: 'Middle: Excellent/Epic primary; Rare is fallback when stall capacity is healthy.',
        mode_passive: 'Passive: Excellent/Epic primary; Rare is sparse exploration.',
        mode_auto: 'Auto: sale/return/opportunity evidence chooses Aggressive, Middle or Passive.',
        scan: 'Run an immediate market scan using current strategy/safety rules; request governors and exact-book verification remain enforced.',
        relist: 'Manual recovery for returned script-owned auction items only. Warehouse smart-reprice/terminal-park stock uses its own exact-goodsId recovery and will not re-enter until a fresh verified non-hold/non-severe plan exists.',
        session: 'Reset only rolling session spend/request limits at the safe request boundary.',
        audit: 'Authoritatively refresh inventory/stash to reconcile delayed or ambiguous deliveries.',
        salesrefresh: 'Ask the server for recent sales and reconcile completed script listings.',
        report: 'Write a full current session/strategy/status report into the auction-sniper log.',
        hudpos: 'Move the larger A55.24 HUD back to its shipped centered position and save it.',
        sell: 'Sweep script-held positions. Safe exits list; collapsed/unsafe exits remain held.',
        warehouse_sell: 'Stash-only liquidation: ranked stock requires selected rarity AND item type; source-identified unranked Affix Gems use the explicit GEMS toggle because Mistfall exposes no normal T1-T7 rarity for them. T5=Epic. Equipment can hold for bind/cooldown/gem/repair/no-safe-price safety. Exact Warehouse listings reprice after 5m no progress (max 4 relists), park after 10m severe-queue no progress or 30m dead no-progress, and re-enter only on a fresh safe exact plan.',
        warehouse_cat_items: 'Warehouse Sell filter only: include MATERIALS / ITEMS — ordinary non-key/non-gem/non-equipment Stash items, including Construction/Forging/Urban/material-type items. This is ANDed with selected rarities. Weapons/Armor/Accessories remain separate explicit categories. Existing listed Warehouse lots keep their auto-reprice lifecycle.',
        warehouse_cat_keys: 'Warehouse Sell filter only: include Stash Keys. This is ANDed with selected rarities. OFF by default so keys stay protected.',
        warehouse_cat_gems: 'Warehouse Sell filter only: include source-identified Affix Gems from Stash. Mistfall gems that expose no normal T1-T7 rarity are controlled by GEMS directly instead of being falsely rejected as T0; any ranked gem still obeys the selected rarity AND category rule. Changing the filter does not affect already-listed Warehouse lots.',
