        warehouse_cat_armor: 'Warehouse Sell filter only: Head/Chest/Gloves/Pants/Shoes armor from Stash. This is ANDed with selected rarities; T5 means Epic.',
        warehouse_cat_accessories: 'Warehouse Sell filter only: Necklace/Ring accessories from Stash. This is ANDed with selected rarities; T5 means Epic.',
        delist: 'Manual maintenance: delist script-owned auction listings only. Manual listings stay protected. Warehouse automatic no-progress delist/reprice/park runs separately while LIVE.',
